  "description": "It’s her! Shy, violent, indecent her! After yet another day of getting told off, me, the hopeless theatrical aspirant, came home to a strange girl swearing next door. The sight of her beating the daylights out of some guy… She’s basically a mobster, I should be careful… Just my luck, having someone like her move in next door… I should avoid her at all costs… But the next day, she kissed me. …What is this girl?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/51403427), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297020451), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=mah0), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/dw_1160), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3457003)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://lalatoon.com/en/webtoon/episode/toon/6945)",
